# Keep the build context tight: ship only pyproject.toml + README*.md + src/.
# Tests, VCS metadata, and Python build byproducts are not needed in the image
# (and excluding them keeps the supply-chain surface minimal — T-15-04-02).
.git
.gitignore
tests/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
